WEBVTT

00:06:28.632 --> 00:06:30.409
I don't want to go to that party,"

00:06:30.433 --> 00:06:32.586
or, "That's too hard for me"?

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.698
SC: Well, I was shy as a child,

00:06:34.722 --> 00:06:38.098
so I had a lot of those moments of shyness

00:06:38.122 --> 00:06:42.142
in situations where
I didn't know the people well.

00:06:42.166 --> 00:06:45.310
Or I was really into figure skating
when I was a kid and, you know,

00:06:45.334 --> 00:06:48.432
every figure skater gets nervous
before they go out on the ice

00:06:48.456 --> 00:06:50.409
for their performance or competition,

00:06:50.433 --> 00:06:55.750
but I really suffered more than
your typical skater would.

00:06:55.774 --> 00:06:59.919
Until I learned how to deal
with that side of myself,

00:06:59.943 --> 00:07:04.090
yeah, that would sort of show up
and get in the way sometimes.